data: {"type":"response.reasoning_summary_text.done","sequence_number":85,"item_id":"rs_00f8533f2aca44c2016acaba8cc1bc8197a032180e6ddb5298","output_index":0,"summary_index":0,"text":"**Considering tests and file management**\n\nI’m thinking about adding tests, and I wonder if I need to write a new file for this purpose. It seems like exporting helpers to easily append unique data at the end might be a good approach. Should I create a standalone test file to avoid duplicating current functionality? I’m also considering how to manage larger tests, maybe around 100 lines, to ensure everything works well without cluttering things up."}

